        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "where the difference operators $\\partial_t$, $\\overline{\\partial}_t$ are the discretization of $\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}$, and the difference operators $\\partial_{x_1}$, $\\overline{\\partial}_{x_1}$ are the discretization of $\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x_1}$. Via these notations and the properties of the difference operators, we present the statement of the local/global conservation laws for the different numerical methods.",
