        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "The following method is constructed based on the method of lines, i.e. discretizing the Hamiltonian PDEs in space, then applying the symplectic method to the resulting Hamiltonian ODEs (see for example [6,22]). Later, we will show the method is also multisymplectic in the corresponding statement of multisymplicity.",
